      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَافِرٌ مُقَعَّبٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A solid hoof likened to a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَعْب</span>;
